Package: plspower
Type: Shiny Application
Title: Monte Carlo Power Analysis Planner for PLS-SEM
Version: 0.8.0
Authors@R: person("Fritz Jeffry", "Briones", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mrcute808@gmail.com")
Description: A Shiny application for prospective Monte Carlo power analysis
    of PLS-SEM mediation models. Reports bootstrap-based and normal-theory
    PLS-SEM power for the direct and indirect effect from a single built-in Mode A engine, against
    regression-based shortcuts (G*Power-equivalent f2 calculation) and the
    Kock-Hadaya inverse square-root rule, with a built-in smoke-test
    fixture, seed-controlled reproducibility, and CSV/JSON export.
